17:["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-gray mt-8 max-w-none prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:text-gray-900 prose-p:leading-7 prose-p:text-gray-600 prose-li:text-gray-600","children":["$","div",null,{"dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>Retention is often more profitable than acquisition. A mobile app gives your business a direct channel to customers through push notifications, personalized content, and quicker access to services.</p><p>The best apps do not just replicate a website. They streamline one core job and make it easier to come back again and again.</p><h2>Retention advantages</h2><ol><li>Faster repeat access</li><li>Personalized experiences</li><li>Push notification reminders</li><li>Better loyalty flows</li></ol>"}}]}]
